    "urlText": "L1 Pyrmont Bay lift out of service",
    "url": "https://transportnsw.info/alerts/details#/ems-46719",
    "content": "<div>\n<div>The lift at Pyrmont Bay light rail stop on the L1 Dulwich Hill Line is temporarily out of service until further notice.</div>\n<div>\n<div>For your safety, do not use even if the doors open.</div>\n<div><br />Alternative access:</div>\n<ul>\n<li>Use the stairs if able to.</li>\n<li>Use the accessible entry/exit pathway via Murray Street and Pirrama Road<br />&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<div>For urgent assistance:&nbsp;</div>\n<ul>\n<li>Use the Help Point if on the platform, or call 131 500</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>",
