    "urlText": "Chatswood Station Lift 1 between the concourse and Platform 3/4 is not available",
    "url": "https://transportnsw.info/alerts/details#/ems-52897",
    "content": "At Chatswood Station Lift 1 between the concourse and Platform 3/4 is temporarily out of service.\nThis lift will be undergoing an upgrade from Thursday 29 May until Friday 6 June 2025.\nIf you are travelling from Chatswood Platforms 3 or 4 and need lift access, take a train from Platform 1 to Artarmon and change for a train towards Hornsby. Or take a metro service from Platform 2 to Crows Nest and change for a metro service towards Tallawong.\nIf you are arriving at Chatswood Platforms 3 or 4 and need lift access, remain on the train to Lindfield and change for a train towards Central arriving at Chatswood Platform 1. Or remain on the metro service to North Ryde and change for a metro service towards Sydenham arriving on Platform 2.\n\nIf you need help, ask staff or phone 02 9379 3311.",
